"{\"activities\":[{\"name\":\"Monitor Seismic Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity represents the monitoring of seismic events, tracking earthquake magnitude to detect potential tsunami threats.\"},{\"name\":\"Issue Tsunami Alert\",\"description\":\"The 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity represents the issuance of a tsunami alert, recording the alert level and estimated arrival time of the tsunami.\"},{\"name\":\"Evacuate Coastal Areas\",\"description\":\"The 'Evacuate Coastal Areas' activity represents the evacuation of populations from coastal areas at risk of a tsunami, tracking the number of evacuees.\"},{\"name\":\"Dispatch Emergency Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity represents the mobilization and deployment of emergency services to the affected disaster zone.\"},{\"name\":\"Establish Emergency Shelters\",\"description\":\"The 'Establish Emergency Shelters' activity represents the setup and opening of emergency shelters for evacuees, tracking the number of shelters opened.\"},{\"name\":\"Assess Infrastructure Damage\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity represents the assessment of damage to infrastructure following a disaster, recording the severity of the damage.\"},{\"name\":\"Provide Medical Assistance\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity represents the provision of medical aid to affected individuals, tracking the number of injuries treated.\"},{\"name\":\"Distribute Relief Supplies\",\"description\":\"The 'Distribute Relief Supplies' activity represents the distribution of relief supplies to affected populations, tracking the cost of supplies distributed.\"},{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity represents the restoration of communication networks that have been disrupted, tracking the current communication status.\"},{\"name\":\"Conduct Search and Rescue\",\"descriptio