ce, ranging from 0 to 5,000.\",\"min_value\":0,\"max_value\":5000,\"enumeration_values\":null},{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Supply Cost\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Supply Cost' represents the cost of relief supplies distributed, ranging from 0.0 to 1,000,000.0.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":1000000.0,\"enumeration_values\":null},{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Communication Status\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Communication Status' specifies the current status of communication networks, which can be Operational, Partially Operational, or Down.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Operational\",\"Partially Operational\",\"Down\"]},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Number of Rescued\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Number of Rescued' represents the number of individuals rescued during search and rescue operations, ranging from 0 to 1,000.\",\"min_value\":0,\"max_value\":1000,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"binds\":[{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Seismic Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity represents the monitoring of seismic events, tracking earthquake magnitude to detect potential tsunami threats.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Magnitude\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Magnitude' represents the earthquake magnitude measured on the Richter scale, ranging from 0.0 to 10.0.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":10.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Monitor Seismic Activity: Magnitude' links the 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity with the 'Magnitude' attribute to track earthquake magnitude during monitoring.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Issue Tsunami Alert\",\"description\":\"The 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity represents the issuance of a tsunami alert, recording the alert level and estimated arrival time of the tsunami.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Alert Level\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Alert Level' speci