the 'Number of Shelters' attribute to track the shelters opened.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Assess Infrastructure Damage\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity represents the assessment of damage to infrastructure following a disaster, recording the severity of the damage.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Damage Severity\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Damage Severity' specifies the severity of infrastructure damage assessed, which can be Minor, Moderate, or Severe.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Minor\",\"Moderate\",\"Severe\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Assess Infrastructure Damage: Damage Severity' links the 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity with the 'Damage Severity' attribute to track damage assessment results.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Provide Medical Assistance\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity represents the provision of medical aid to affected individuals, tracking the number of injuries treated.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Number of Injuries\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Number of Injuries' represents the number of injuries requiring medical assistance, ranging from 0 to 5,000.\",\"min_value\":0,\"max_value\":5000,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Provide Medical Assistance: Number of Injuries' links the 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity with the 'Number of Injuries' attribute to track the number of injuries treated.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Distribute Relief Supplies\",\"description\":\"The 'Distribute Relief Supplies' activity represents the distribution of relief supplies to affected populations, tracking the cost of supplies distributed.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Supply Cost\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Supply Cost' represents the cost of relief supplies distributed, ranging from 0.0 to 1,000,000.0.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":1000