nse protocol.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Seismic Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity represents the monitoring of seismic events, tracking earthquake magnitude to detect potential tsunami threats.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity occurs and the Magnitude is greater than 7.0, then the 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity must occur immediately after in the next event position, with no other events in between. This directly triggers a tsunami alert when seismic magnitude exceeds 7.0.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Seismic Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity represents the monitoring of seismic events, tracking earthquake magnitude to detect potential tsunami threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Issue Tsunami Alert\",\"description\":\"The 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity represents the issuance of a tsunami alert, recording the alert level and estimated arrival time of the tsunami.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Magnitude > 7.0\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity occurs, then the 'Evacuate Coastal Areas' activity must eventually follow. The evacuation must occur within 60 minutes of the alert being issued.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Issue Tsunami Alert\",\"description\":\"The 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity represents the issuance of a tsunami alert, recording the alert level and estimated arrival time of the tsunami.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Evacuate Coastal Areas\",\"description\":\"The 'Evacuate Coastal Areas' activity represents the evacuation of populations from coastal areas at risk of a tsunami, tracking the number of evacuees.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,60,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity occurs, then the 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity must eventually follow. Medical assistance must be provided within 24 hours of dispatching emergency services.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Dispatch Emergency Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity represents the mobilization and deployment of emergency services to the affected disaster zone.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Provide Medical Assistance\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity represents the provision of medical aid to affected individuals, tracking the number of injuries treated.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Establish Emergency Shelters' activity occurs, then the 'Distribute Relief Supplies' activity must eventually follow. Relief supplies must be distributed within 48 hours of establishing the shelters.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Establish Emergency Shelters\",\"description\":\"The 'Establish Emergency Shelters' activity represents the setup and opening of emergency shelters for evacuees, tracking the number of shelters opened.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Distribute Relief Supplies\",\"description\":\"The 'Distribute Relief Supplies' activity represents the distribution of relief supplies to affected populations, tracking the cost of supplies distributed.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,48,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity occurs, then the 'Restore Communication Networks' activity must eventually follow. Communication restoration must begin within 72 hours of the damage assessment.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Assess Infrastructure Damage\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity represents the assessment of damage to infrastructure following a disaster, recording the severity of the damage.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity represents the restoration of communication networks that have been disrupted, tracking the current communication status.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,72,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance. Emergency services must be dispatched before medical assistance can be provided.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Provide Medical Assistance\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity represents the provision of medical aid to affected individuals, tracking the number of injuries treated.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Dispatch Emergency Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity represents the mobilization and deployment of emergency services to the affected disaster zone.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Search and Rescue' activity and the 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity cannot both occur within the same process instance. If one of these activities occurs, the other is strictly forbidden. This mutual exclusion prevents concurrent execution of conflicting disaster response operations.\",\"template\":\"Not Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Search and Rescue\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Search and Rescue' activity represents the search and rescue operations to find and save individuals affected by the disaster, tracking the number of individuals rescued.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Assess Infrastructure Damage\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity represents the assessment of damage to infrastructure following a disaster, recording the severity of the damage.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Restore Communication Networks' activity occurs and the Communication Status is 'Down', then the 'Restore Communication Networks' activity must eventually occur again. This iterative loop continues until the Communication Status becomes 'Operational', ensuring communication networks are fully restored.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity represents the restoration of communication networks that have been disrupted, tracking the current communication status.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity represents the restoration of communication networks that have been disrupted, tracking the current communication status.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Communication Status is Down\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null}]}"